  </item>
  <item>
    <title>岛屿青年戏剧节：鼓浪屿上的文本实验与青年能量 [黑熊×映现场对话共鸣之墙]</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696886656b0ac80653253e72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696886656b0ac80653253e72</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Jan 2026 05:36:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/6a60-audiofreehighqps/A9/7C/GKwRIJINP4IHACN4VgRaK_p1.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><br><p><span>本期节目是黑熊电台与播客[映现场]的联合串台，聚焦2025年底在厦门鼓浪屿首次举办的“岛屿青年戏剧节”。我们邀请到本次戏剧节的总策划、“共鸣之墙”戏剧书店老板陈老师，聊聊戏剧节的筹备、鼓浪屿独特的空间与文化氛围、青年戏剧市场的现状与挑战，以及文本先行的策展理念。节目中还分享了厦门本地书店、戏剧活动的趣事，探讨了青年戏剧人的生存状态、观众体验、演出物料搬运的幕后故事，以及未来戏剧节的可能走向。</span></p><br><p><b><span>本期节目嘉宾</span></b></p><br><p><span>车厘子（映现场、心流公园主播）</span></p><p><span>墙老板“陈老师”（共鸣之墙主理人、首届“岛屿青年戏剧节”总策划）</span></p><br><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/d1da-audiofreehighqps/07/75/GAqhVp8NP4HxAAwHmwRaK-oW.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>黑熊电台的年度周边：文创年历海报现已发售，请移步GZH购买。（特别适合追戏人群）</span></p><br><p><b><span>SHOWNOTE&nbsp;</span></b></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;本人碎碎念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;嘉宾陈老师自我介绍&nbsp; （正片此处开始）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;乌镇戏剧节投票趣事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;为什么选12月在厦门办</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;鼓浪屿空间与交通特色</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;场地选择与鼓浪屿定位</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;厦门文艺活动的变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;乌镇戏剧节摆摊与剧本市场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;内容设置与青年对谈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;文本改编与女性议题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;剧团邀请与青年成长</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3067">51:07</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;非职剧团与多元包容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;亲民票价与观众反馈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;场地搬迁与剧团适应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;青年剧团活力与互动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3825">01:03:45</a> 在地创作与素材采集</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4237">01:10:37</a> 活动多元与产业链建设</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4443">01:14:03</a> 曼丽计划与青年编剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4724">01:18:44</a> 差异化与编剧权重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5189">01:26:29</a> 空间、观众与打卡体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5342">01:29:02</a> 主创与观众交流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5467">01:31:07</a> 明星参与与网红化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5614">01:33:34</a> 理想主义与市场化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5978">01:39:38</a> 在地文化与本地融合</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6091">01:41:31</a> 未来展望与联动计划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6331">01:45:31</a> 结语与互动方式</span></p><br><p><span>再次感谢共鸣之墙、鼓浪屿美院以及映现场的车厘子老师，期待下次相聚。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIaINPkDjAxYSJgRZo6Gi.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=19253928&amp;track_id=949303214&amp;uid=71813343&amp;jt=https://podcast.xmcdn.com/storages/0cc6-audiofreehighqps/A0/CA/GKwRIaINPkDjAxYSJgRZo6Gi.m4a" length="51778086" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:46:36</itunes:duration>
